  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan uses yellow apricot immortal essence and activates refine self. A pale yellow light the size of a fist flows from near his stomach around his body, with the emphasis on his injuries. Starlight and golden aurora on the wounds are refined: these are dao marks left by Star Constellation Immortal Venerable and Giant Sun Immortal Venerable. The refinement brings intense pain. The light lingers on the detached arm for about one hour, then fades.",
      "chapters": [
        2215
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Refine self can refine all of the dao marks on the Gu cultivator’s body into their own. Its origin is the killer move he once used, self cleansing. In the Crazed Demon Cave battle, he refined all of the dao marks of flying star and countered Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s consecutive move. He also exposed trump cards like refine self, which need modification before they can be used again.",
      "chapters": [
        2215
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan uses refine self and refines all of the wood path and refinement path dao marks.",
